   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "How long does it take?",
   "texto": [
    "**날씨** = time. **날씨가 어때요?** = what time does it make?",
    "**더워요** (hot), **추워요** (cold), **따뜻해요** (good, temperate), **시원해요** (cool).",
    "**맑아요** (is clear), **흐려요** (is clouded).",
    "«Come»: **비가 와요** (rain; «The rain is coming») and **눈이 와요** (snow) are used for rain and snow. The wind «blow»: **바람이 불어요**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The stations",
   "texto": [
